---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout sideBarActiveItemID="home">
  <div class="pb-2 mt-5">
    <div class="text-4xl font-bold">Ye Rin Park</div>
    <div class="text-xl py-2 opacity-80">Ph.D. Candidate</div>
    <div class="opacity-80">
      Department of Chemical &amp; Biomolecular Engineering, KAIST<br />
      Systems Biology and Medicine Lab &mdash; Advisor: Prof. Hyun Uk Kim
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-10 mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold mb-3">About Me</div>
    <div class="text-justify">
      <p class="mb-4">
        My research focuses on AI-driven systems biology and precision oncology, particularly cancer
        drug resistance, therapeutic target discovery, and interpretable and causal machine learning.
        My background spans multi-omics, metabolomics, and mechanism-of-action studies, including
        three years of industry experience as an OMICS Researcher.
      </p>
      <p>
        In my Ph.D. research, I develop computational frameworks that integrate patient, cell line,
        and transcriptomic data to identify actionable cancer targets and characterize drug resistance
        mechanisms. I am particularly interested in connecting biomedical data, mechanistic
        understanding, and therapeutic decision making.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-10">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold mb-3">Research Interests</div>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
      <span class="badge badge-outline p-3">AI-driven Systems Biology</span>
      <span class="badge badge-outline p-3">Precision Oncology</span>
      <span class="badge badge-outline p-3">Cancer Drug Resistance &amp; Re-sensitization</span>
      <span class="badge badge-outline p-3">Therapeutic Target Discovery</span>
      <span class="badge badge-outline p-3">Interpretable &amp; Causal Machine Learning</span>
      <span class="badge badge-outline p-3">AI-guided Drug Discovery</span>
      <span class="badge badge-outline p-3">Translational Bioinformatics</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div>
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold mb-5">Selected Publications</div>

    <div class="mb-6">
      <p>
        Yoon, S. H., Park, Y. R., &amp; Kim, H. U. (2026).
        <span class="font-semibold">A Bayesian network-based framework for causal cancer drug target discovery integrating patient and cell line data.</span>
        Preprint. DOI:
        <a class="link" href="https://doi.org/10.64898/2026.07.13.736676" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">10.64898/2026.07.13.736676</a>
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="divider my-0"></div>

    <div class="my-6">
      <p>
        Park, Y. R., et al. (2023).
        <span class="font-semibold">Systemic multiomics evaluation of the therapeutic effect of Bacteroides species on liver cirrhosis in male mice.</span>
        Microbiology Spectrum, 11(6), e05349.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
